breaking_changes.Adaptation_method:
Replace any usage of uuid.parse() and uuid.unparse() with a downstream parsing/conversion utility. For example, to convert from a buffer to a UUID string or vice versa, use a dedicated library such as 'uuid-parse' (https://github.com/zefferus/uuid-parse). Example replacement:

// Before:
const uuidString = uuid.unparse(someBuffer);
const buffer = uuid.parse(uuidString);

// After:
const uuidParse = require('uuid-parse');
const uuidString = uuidParse.unparse(someBuffer);
const buffer = uuidParse.parse(uuidString);

Alternatively, implement your own buffer/string conversion logic as needed.
